# This repository is designed to live inside an NVR recording store. Deny all
# paths by default, then allow only the application source. This makes a plain
# `git add .` safe even when terabytes of footage sit beside these files.
*
!.gitignore
!.env.example
!README.md
!compose.yaml
!app/
!app/**
!tests/
!tests/**

# Never publish local configuration or generated Python files.
.env
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
